{
  "abstract": "The actual mixed-history recursion has its own master/state/reachability and accepts every exact selector and valid finite pool. Initialization has three branches: an empty relaxation certifies original infeasibility; an admitted integral relaxation minimizer returns a direct exact original minimum without stored-event provenance or loop decisions; fractional initialization runs the mixed loop, yielding certified infeasibility or a stored original-feasible epsilon-optimum with retained decorated-event provenance, exact at epsilon zero. The bound activeY.card+1<=integers.card+1 concerns main loop decisions in the loop branch, not all pooled fixed solves or initialization.",
